        <term_definitions code="at0004">
            <items id="text">Individual</items>
            <items id="description">Identification of the subject of the certificate.</items>
            <items id="comment">This SLOT identifies the subject of the certificate. In comprehensive openEHR EHRs this may be redundant if the formal demographics service or master patient index supplies details about the subject of the certificate. If the subject of the certificate is not the subject of care, this information may need to be entered manually, for example a parent of the child patient. In addition, when creating a screen layout or template for printing, a subset of the CLUSTER.person could be constrained to represent the precise details appropriate for the use case.</items>
        </term_definitions>
